<title>SLOVAKIA: DETAILS OF SLOVAK FINANCE MINISTRY T-BILL AUCTIONS.</title>
<headline>DETAILS OF SLOVAK FINANCE MINISTRY T-BILL AUCTIONS.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Slovak</p>
<p>Finance Ministry's two treasury bill auctions on Wednesday:</p>
<p> 40-week T-bills			 Nov 20	   Nov 14</p>
<p> Bids (billion crowns)		  4.270	    1.089</p>
<p> Bids accepted			    3.970	    0.209</p>
<p> Minimum yield (pct)		    9.90	     9.90</p>
<p> Average yield (pct)		   10.12	     9.99</p>
<p> Maximum yield (pct)		   10.99	    10.00</p>
<p> Maturity date			Aug 28, 1997   Aug 14, 1997</p>
<p> Four-week T-bills		     Nov 20	   Oct 23</p>
<p> Bids (in billion crowns)	    1.334	    6.124</p>
<p> Bids accepted			   1.234	    7.014</p>
<p> Minimum yield (pct)		   9.50	     8.960</p>
<p> Average yield (pct)		  10.04	     9.206</p>
<p> Maximum yield  (pct)		 10.49	     9.250</p>
<p> Maturity date			  Dec 19	    Nov 14</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
